# Java Coding Guidelines

## Style

- Java 21, Spring Boot 4.x; package root `com.company.sage`
- Constructor injection only; no field `@Autowired`
- Prefer `record` for DTOs; 4-space indent
- Match existing style; do not add Lombok unless already used
- Config under `sage.*`; secrets from env only — never hardcode
- Comments explain WHY (business/contract reasons), not WHAT

## Exceptions

- Retrieval tools: fail-soft — catch, return empty list, continue other path
- Unrecoverable ask: SSE `error` event `{"message":"..."}` — not a generic REST body
- Never swallow exceptions; log with `correlationId` when available
- Error messages: helpful, no internals/stack traces to clients
- Do not invent Orion calls from Java; retrieval via Python Graph RAG client
